  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: arbitrary file overwrite through a symlink planted at\n     the predictable temporary PPD path in copy_model().\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-55480.patch: open the temporary PPD file with\n       O_EXCL and O_NOFOLLOW.\n     - CVE-2026-55480\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: file disclosure through path traversal in the banner\n     path built from attributes-natural-language.\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-61702.patch: reject requests with an invalid\n       attributes-natural-language value.\n     - CVE-2026-61702\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: PPD keyword injection through control characters in\n     printer-supplied strings reported by the ipp backend.\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-55453.patch: replace control characters in\n       quoted IPP attribute strings with spaces.\n     - CVE-2026-55453",
